      <p><strong>About <span class="mfs-brand">Musfira's</span>:</strong> <span class="mfs-brand">Musfira's</span> is an online fashion brand offering ladies' bags, jewellery, wallets, watches and fashion accessories, along with a small selection for men. The products shown on this site are selected, listed, sold and delivered by <span class="mfs-brand">Musfira's</span>. When you place an order here, your order is with <span class="mfs-brand">Musfira's</span>.</p>

      <p><strong>Placing an Order:</strong> Submitting an order on our site is a request to purchase. To protect both you and us, our team may contact you by phone or WhatsApp to verify your details and confirm the order. Your order is processed once it has been confirmed. We may decline or cancel an order if the details cannot be verified, the number is unreachable, or an item is no longer available &#8212; in which case we will let you know.</p>

      <p><strong>Prices &amp; Payment:</strong> All prices are shown in <strong>AED</strong>. Payment is made by <span class="mfs-elite-text">Cash on Delivery</span>: you pay the courier when your parcel is handed to you. Prices and offers may change from time to time without prior notice, but the price shown at the time you place your order is the price we will honour for that order. If an obvious pricing error occurs, we reserve the right to correct it and will contact you before proceeding.</p>

      <p><strong>Delivery:</strong> We deliver within the United Arab Emirates through trusted courier partners. Standard delivery typically takes <strong class="mfs-pink">1&#8211;3 working days</strong> after dispatch. These are estimates, not fixed promises, and may be affected by courier schedules, public holidays, weather or other circumstances outside our control. Any delivery charge is shown clearly at checkout before you confirm. Please provide a complete address and a phone number on which you can be reached, as couriers will contact you before delivery.</p>

      <p><strong>Tracking:</strong> When your order is dispatched, we will send you the courier's name, your tracking ID and a tracking link on WhatsApp so you can follow your parcel.</p>

      <p><strong>Returns, Exchanges &amp; Refunds:</strong> We want you to be happy with your purchase. If your item arrives damaged, defective, or different from what you ordered, please contact us promptly after delivery with your Order ID and clear photos, and we will review your case and resolve it fairly. To be eligible for a return or exchange, items should generally be unused and in their original condition and packaging. Please inspect your parcel at the time of delivery wherever possible.</p>

      <p><strong>Product Information &amp; Colours:</strong> We work hard to present our products accurately. However, colours may appear slightly different depending on your screen settings and lighting, and small variations in size or finish can occur in handmade or leather items.</p>

